@page 
@model Website.Pages.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
    
}

<div class="p-3">
    
     <!-- Page title -->
    <div class="page-title-container">
        <h1 class="display-4">Special Night</h1>
        <p class="lead"></p>
    </div>

    <!-- info -->
    <div class="mb-5 company-description">
        <p class="paragraph-tab">Special Night is a premium clothing rental company that specializes in renting out dresses for ladies and suits for men.
             Founded in 2010 by mateo,
             the company started out as a small-scale business with just a handful of dresses and suits available for rent.</p>
        <p class="paragraph-tab">However, with their unique and affordable rental options, Special Night quickly gained popularity among the local community. Within a year of its inception,
            the company's inventory grew, and they expanded their collection to include a variety of styles and sizes to cater to all customers' needs.</p>
        <p class="paragraph-tab">Today, Special Night has become a leading rental service provider in the region, offering top-quality dresses and suits from renowned fashion designers at competitive prices. With a user-friendly online platform and an easy-to-navigate rental process,
             customers can browse through the company's extensive collection and select the perfect outfit for their special occasion.</p>
        <p class="paragraph-tab">Whether it's a wedding, prom, or a gala event, Special Night's rental service provides customers with the opportunity to dress to impress without breaking the bank.
             From elegant ball gowns to chic tuxedos, the company's collection has something for everyone.</p>
        <p class="paragraph-tab">With a team of dedicated and passionate staff, Special Night is committed to providing exceptional customer service and ensuring that every customer has a seamless rental experience.
            So, whether you're attending a black-tie event or a casual dinner party, trust Special Night to help you look and feel your best.</p>
        <p class="paragraph-tab"><strong>Cleaning is covered by our company. The rental period is of 5 days maximum. Each extra day is €50.</strong></p>
    </div>
   

    <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-sm-6 index-pictures text-center">
            <img src="~/Pictures/blue dress.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Blue dress.">
        </div>
    <div class="col-sm-6 index-pictures text-center">
            <img src="~/Pictures/black dress.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Black dress.">
        </div>
    <div class="col-sm-6 index-pictures text-center">
            <img src="~/Pictures/red dress.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="Red dress.">
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
